<title>UK: BayerLB sets 100 mln mark 10-yr fixed/reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 100 mln mark 10-yr fixed/reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Landesbank and Morgan Stanley (books).</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **11	  MATURITY    01.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  102.125   PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/MUN   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  2.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR YEAR ONE, THEN 16 PCT MINUS (2 X 6M LIBOR)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
